:: Deadwood Remy Captivity Widgets [widget]
<<widget 'deadwood-remy-captivity'>>
  <<set $_remy to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
  <<if !$_remy?.captive>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<npc Remy>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<if $phase is 0>>You can still feel where <<his>> glove disturbed your hair. Remy pauses outside the cell to give a farmhand instructions.<<else>>Remy brushes the last piece of straw from <<his>> glove. <<He>> says something to a farmhand further down the barn, too quietly for you to hear.<</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<if $phase is 0>>你还能感觉到头发被<<his>>手套揉乱的地方。雷米在栏门外停下，吩咐一名工人做事。<<else>>雷米拂掉手套上最后一根稻草，又向谷仓深处的工人说了些什么。声音太轻，你听不清楚。<</if>>
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if $Orchard.remy.syndrome>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You listen for the keys after the footsteps stop. A little longer at your gate would have been enough. <span class='red'>You find yourself wishing <<he>> would come back.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        脚步停下后，你仍留意着钥匙的响声。只要在栏门旁再多陪一会儿就够了。<span class='red'>你不由得盼着<<he>>回来。</span>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif $Orchard.remy.romance>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The footsteps slow beyond your gate. The same gloves rested on the riding school desk when you spoke of being partners. <span class='purple'>Here, the keys hang from Remy's belt.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        脚步声在你的栏门外慢下来。谈起交往那天，这双手套就放在骑术学校的桌上。<span class='purple'>在这里，钥匙挂在雷米腰间。</span>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif $Orchard.remy.visits gt 0>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You have heard that voice giving instructions to pupils. You remember the lesson register and the row of cups beside the kettle. <span class='purple'>Here, <<he>> has not asked whether you want to stay.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你听过这个声音指导学员。你想起课程登记簿，以及水壶旁的一排杯子。<span class='purple'>在这里，<<he>>没有问过你想不想留下。</span>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<deadwood-remy-pregnancy-links>>
  <div id='deadwood-remy-cell-talk'>
    <<if $_remy.canTalk>>
      <<lanLink ['Call after Remy', '叫住雷米']>>
        <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.captive and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canTalk>>
          <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-talk'>>
            <<deadwood-remy-cell-menu>>
          <</replace>>
        <</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  </div>
  <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canFarmIntimacy>>
    <!-- 谷仓这一侧不看交往，看的是够不够听话。他自己不说要走，也不问你想不想。 -->
    <div id='deadwood-remy-cell-intimacy'>
      <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink ['Stay where Remy can reach you', '任由雷米伸手抚弄'] 'Deadwood Remy Cell Intimacy'>>
        <<if !maplebirch.get('Orchard').remy.startFarmIntimacy()>><<set $Orchard.remy.intimacy_site to 'barn'>><</if>>
        <<set $sexstart to 1>>
      <</lanLink>><<promiscuous1>><br>
    </div>
  <</if>>
  <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>
    <div id='deadwood-remy-cell-break'>
      <<lanLink ['Say the relationship is over', '提出结束关系']>>
        <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-break'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              You can tell Remy that whatever was between you is dead. <span class='red'>Ending this changes nothing about the locked gate or the farm.</span>
            <<option 'CN'>>
              你可以告诉雷米，你们之间那点所谓的温情已经到头了。<span class='red'>斩断这段关系改变不了被反锁的铁栏，也动摇不了这座农场。</span>
          <</language>><br>
          <<lanLink ['End the relationship', '结束关系']>>
            <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.act('break')>>
              <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-break'>>
                <<language>>
                  <<option 'EN'>>
                    "There is nothing between us anymore," you say through the bars. Remy stops, giving you a cold, measuring look, then gives a dry scoff. "Did you think that would buy you an unlocked gate? We're back to what this always was." The keys clink against <<his>> hip as <<he>> strides away. <span class='blue'>You no longer consider <<him>> your partner.</span>
                  <<option 'CN'>>
                    “我们之间彻底完了，”你隔着铁栏冷冷地开口。雷米停下脚步，用冷淡审度的目光看了你一眼，短促地嗤笑了一声。“你以为这就能让我开锁放你出去？不过是回到从前应有的模样罢了。”钥匙在<<his>>腰侧撞击作响，<<he>>没有回头，径直向谷仓深处走去。<span class='blue'>你不再把<<him>>当作恋人。</span>
                <</language>>
              <</replace>>
            <</if>>
          <</lanLink>><br>
          <<lanLink ['Remain silent', '暂时不说']>>
            <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-break'>><</replace>>
          <</lanLink>>
        <</replace>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    </div>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>


<<widget 'deadwood-remy-cell-menu'>>
  <<set $_remy to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
  <<if !$_remy?.captive or !$_remy.canTalk>><<exit>><</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The footsteps stop. "What is it?" Remy asks from beyond the gate. <<He>> stays on the other side.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      脚步声停了。“怎么了？”雷米在栏门外问道。<<He>>没有回来开门。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-remy-bond>>
  <<lanLink ['Ask to leave', '要求离开']>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.captive and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canTalk>>
      <<set $Orchard.remy.last_talk_day to Time.days>>
      <<if !$Orchard.remy.syndrome>><<set $Orchard.remy.stockholm to Math.max(0, $Orchard.remy.stockholm - 20)>><</if>>
      <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-talk'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
          <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>"Open the gate. I'm going home."<<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>"Please. I want to go home."<<else>>"I want to leave," you say.<</if>> Remy turns a key between <<his>> fingers. "And I'd like a quiet morning." <<He>> lets it drop against the others.
          <br><br>
          <<if $livestock.obey gte 80>>"You've been settling in so well. Why spoil it?" <<He>> looks towards the farmhands. "You'll be brought out with the others."<<else>>"You're making this harder than it needs to be. You'll be brought out when it's time." <<He>> waits, as if expecting you to thank <<him>>.<</if>> <<He>> walks away before you can answer.
          <<option 'CN'>>
          <<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>“开门，我要回家。”<<elseif $speech_attitude is 'meek'>>“求你了，我想回家。”<<else>>“我要离开。”你说。<</if>> 雷米用手指转着一把钥匙。“我倒想要个清静的早上。”钥匙落回那一串金属上。
          <br><br>
          <<if $livestock.obey gte 80>>“你明明适应得很好，何必弄成这样？”<<He>>看向工人。“到时候，会带你跟其他的一起出去。”<<else>>“非得把事情弄得这么难办。到了时候，自然有人带你出去。”<<He>>等了一下，仿佛还等着你道谢。<</if>> 你还没来得及回答，<<he>>便走远了。
        <</language>><br><br>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            <span class='red'>Remy has refused to let you leave.</span>
          <<option 'CN'>>
            <span class='red'>雷米没有答应放你离开。</span>
        <</language>>
      <</replace>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<if $Orchard.remy.romance>>
    <<lanLink ['Ask about your agreement', '追问你们的约定']>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.captive and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canTalk>>
        <<set $Orchard.remy.last_talk_day to Time.days>>
        <<if !$Orchard.remy.syndrome>><<set $Orchard.remy.stockholm to Math.max(0, $Orchard.remy.stockholm - 20)>><</if>>
        <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-talk'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
            <<if $Orchard.remy.syndrome>>You tell Remy that wanting to be together does not mean wanting to be locked up. "We are together," <<he>> says. "You're right here."<<else>>"You said I could come back because I wanted to." Remy's hand stills on the keys. "And you did come back." You tell <<him>> that this was not the place you agreed to meet.<</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<He>> follows your gaze towards the gate. "You have a place here. Everything's provided for." You ask if <<he>> would talk to you like this at the school. A farmhand looks over. Remy waits until they turn away. "Don't make it difficult." <<His>> boots scrape the straw as <<he>> leaves.
            <<option 'CN'>>
            <<if $Orchard.remy.syndrome>>你告诉雷米，想和<<him>>在一起，不等于想被关起来。“我们就在一起。”<<He>>说。“你就在这儿。”<<else>>“你说过，我可以因为自己想来而回来。”雷米摆弄钥匙的手停了。“而你确实回来了。”你告诉<<him>>，你们约好的地方可不是这里。<</if>>
            <br><br>
            <<He>>顺着你的目光看向栏门。“这里有你的位置，什么都给你安排好了。”你问，在学校里，<<he>>也会这样跟你说话吗。一名工人望过来。雷米等对方转开视线，才说：“别把事情弄得太难办。”<<He>>走开时，皮靴擦过稻草。
          <</language>><br><br>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
              <span class='purple'>The keys stay on <<his>> belt.</span>
            <<option 'CN'>>
              <span class='purple'>钥匙仍挂在<<his>>腰带上。</span>
          <</language>>
        <</replace>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<elseif $Orchard.remy.visits gt 0>>
    <<lanLink ['Mention the riding school', '提起骑术学校']>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.captive and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canTalk>>
        <<set $Orchard.remy.last_talk_day to Time.days>>
        <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-talk'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
            You mention the lessons, and the people waiting in the courtyard. "Different arrangements," Remy says. "They pay for their keep." You ask what you are supposed to be doing here, then. <<He>> glances towards the far end of the barn. "What you're told."
            <br><br>
            "You didn't speak to me like this there." Remy smooths a fold in <<his>> glove. "You listened rather better there." <<He>> leaves before you can ask another question. The schoolyard comes back to you for a moment: people laughing, unfastened gates, everyone leaving at the end of a lesson.
            <<option 'CN'>>
            你提起课程，以及在庭院里等候的人们。“安排不一样。”雷米说。“他们付钱。”你问，那你在这里到底算什么。<<He>>朝谷仓另一端瞥了一眼。“照吩咐做事就行。”
            <br><br>
            “你在那边可不是这样跟我说话的。”雷米理平手套上的一道褶皱。“你在那边也更肯听话。”你还没来得及再问，<<he>>便离开了。庭院一瞬间又浮现在你脑海里：说笑的人，敞开的门，以及上完课就能回家的学员。
          <</language>>
        <</replace>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <<else>>
    <<lanLink ['Ask why you are kept here', '问为什么要把你关在这里']>>
      <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.captive and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canTalk>>
        <<set $Orchard.remy.last_talk_day to Time.days>>
        <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-talk'>>
          <<language>>
            <<option 'EN'>>
            Remy tilts <<his>> head. "You've a roof over you, and someone to feed you." <<He>> taps the gate with one gloved finger. "You'd do better thinking about what you can do for me." A worker calls from further down the barn. Remy raises <<his>> hand in answer and leaves. The sound of the keys follows <<him>>.
            <<option 'CN'>>
            雷米偏了偏头。“你有地方住，也有人喂你。”<<He>>用戴着手套的手指敲了敲栏门。“不如想想，你能为我做些什么。”谷仓深处传来工人的呼喊。雷米抬手回应，走开了。钥匙声也跟着远去。
          <</language>>
        <</replace>>
      <</if>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<lanLink ['Ask what work you will be made to do', '问接下来要做什么']>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.captive and maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canTalk>>
      <<set $Orchard.remy.last_talk_day to Time.days>>
      <<replace '#deadwood-remy-cell-talk'>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
          "You'll be told," Remy says. "Same as everyone else." A farmhand raises a hand further down the barn, holding something <<he>> needs to check. Remy answers with a nod.
          <br><br>
          <<if $livestock.winter.active>>"It's cold outside. You'll be staying in the barn." You ask whether that means you can rest. "It means the work's inside."<<else>>You glance towards the barn doors. "You'll get some fresh air," <<he>> says, following your gaze. "No need to look so worried."<</if>> <<He>> resumes walking, already calling instructions to someone else.
          <<option 'CN'>>
          “到时候会告诉你。”雷米说。“跟其他的一样。”谷仓深处的一名工人举起手里的东西，等<<he>>过去查看。雷米点头回应。
          <br><br>
          <<if $livestock.winter.active>>“外面冷，你会留在谷仓里。”你问，是不是能休息了。“是说活计在里面做。”<<else>>你望向谷仓的大门。“会让你呼吸点新鲜空气的。”<<He>>顺着你的视线看去。“不用那么担心。”<</if>> <<He>>继续往前走，已经在吩咐另一个人做事。
        <</language>>
      <</replace>>
    <</if>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Remy Cell Intimacy
<<set _remy to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
<<if !maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy.canFarmIntimacy or $Orchard.remy.last_intimacy_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $sexstart to 0>>
  <<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Livestock Cell'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
<<else>>
  <<if $sexstart is 1>>
    <<set $sexstart to 0>>
    <<clearnpc>><<npc Remy>><<person1>><<run statusCheck('Remy')>>
    <<controlloss>><<violence 1>><<neutral 1>>
    <<molested>><<set $consensual to 0>>
    <<maninit>><<set $enemyarousalmax to 600>>
    <<npcincr Remy dom 1>>
    <!-- 开场：手套、栏门、钥匙。三样都不离开原地。 -->
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Remy does not open the gate. <<He>> reaches through it instead, one gloved hand closing around the back of your neck — not hard, just enough that you feel the shape of <<his>> grip and understand it is not going to move on its own.
        <br><br>
        <span class='lewd'>"You've been standing there since the last round of feed," <<he>> says. "I've been watching you decide something all afternoon."</span> The keys on <<his>> belt knock against the bars as <<he>> leans in. <<He>> does not unpick the lock, and does not explain how this is going to work.
        <br><br>
        <span class='lewd'>It works the way everything here works: you reach for <<him>> through the bars, and <<he>> lets you.</span>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        雷米没有打开栏门。<<He>>只是把手伸进来，戴着手套的一只按住你后颈——不重，刚好让你记住这只手的形状，并且明白它不会自己松开。
        <br><br>
        <span class='lewd'>“上一轮饲料之后你就一直站在这儿。”<<he>>说。“我看你犹豫了一下午。”</span> <<He>>俯身过来时，腰间那串钥匙磕在栏杆上。<<He>>没有去开锁，也没解释接下来要怎么办。
        <br><br>
        <span class='lewd'>这里的事情都按同一个规矩办：你隔着栏杆伸手去够<<him>>，而<<he>>由着你够。</span>
    <</language>>
    <<promiscuity1>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<set $enemyanger to 0>>
  <<effects>><<effectsman>><<man>><<stateman>>
  <<if $enemyarousal gt 0 and $enemyarousal lt $enemyarousalmax and !_combatend>>
    <<set _heat to $enemyarousal / $enemyarousalmax>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if _heat lt 0.34>>
          The bars are the problem. Remy solves it by ordering you where <<he>> wants you and taking what <<he>> can reach, gloves on, keys swinging, patient as somebody who has all night and knows you do not.
        <<elseif _heat lt 0.67>>
          <span class='lewd'>Somewhere further down the barn a farmhand is still working. Remy does not lower <<his>> voice, and does not tell them to leave.</span>
        <<else>>
          <span class='lewd'>"Look at me," <<he>> says, and waits — far longer than is comfortable — until you do.</span>
        <</if>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if _heat lt 0.34>>
          栏杆挡着。雷米的办法是把你摆到他要的位置上，然后只拿他伸手能够到的那部分——手套没摘，钥匙在晃，耐心得像个有一整晚、并且清楚你并没有的人。
        <<elseif _heat lt 0.67>>
          <span class='lewd'>谷仓深处还有工人在干活。雷米不压低声音，也没有让人出去。</span>
        <<else>>
          <span class='lewd'>“看着我。”<<he>>说，然后等着——比你舒服的时限长得多——一直等到你照做。</span>
        <</if>>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<actionsman>>
  <<if _combatend or $consensual isnot 0>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Remy Cell Intimacy Finish'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <<else>>
    <span id='next'><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Deadwood Remy Cell Intimacy'>><</lanLink>></span><<nexttext>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>

:: Deadwood Remy Cell Intimacy Finish
<<set _remy to maplebirch.get('Orchard')?.remy>>
<<effects>><<person1>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
  <<ejaculation>><<npcincr Remy lust -20>><<npcincr Remy dom 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Remy finishes without hurrying and without any particular ceremony, then takes <<his>> glove off to wipe <<his>> fingers, which is the most consideration <<he>> has shown all afternoon.
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'>"Same time tomorrow," <<he>> says — not a question.</span> <<He>> refastens the gate by habit rather than by need; it was never unlocked. <<His>> keys settle back against <<his>> belt, and <<his>> footsteps start down the centre of the barn.
      <br><br>
      <span class='red'>You are still where <<he>> left you.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      雷米不紧不慢地做完，也没什么特别的仪式感，之后才摘掉手套擦了擦手——这是他这一下午表现出的最体贴的一个动作。
      <br><br>
      <span class='lewd'>“明天还是这个时间。”<<he>>说——不是问句。</span> <<He>>习惯性地把栏门又扣了一道，其实那门从头到尾就没开过。钥匙落回腰间，脚步声沿着谷仓中间走远。
      <br><br>
      <span class='red'>你还站在<<he>>放你站的地方。</span>
  <</language>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You stop. Remy withdraws <<his>> hand from the bars at once, and looks at you for a long moment.
      <br><br>
      "No?" <<He>> tucks the glove back into place. <span class='red'>"You'll change your mind."</span> <<He>> says it the way <<he>> says everything — as a fact already settled — and walks off before you can answer.
      <br><br>
      <span class='purple'>Nothing was locked. Nothing was opened, either.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你叫停了。雷米立刻把手从栏杆间收回去，看了你很久。
      <br><br>
      “不做了？”<<He>>把手套重新戴好。<span class='red'>“你会改主意的。”</span> <<He>>说这句话的语气和别人没有区别——像在陈述一件已经定下的事——说完就走了，没等你回答。
      <br><br>
      <span class='purple'>没有任何东西被锁上。也没有任何东西被打开。</span>
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Remy simply stops, and pulls the glove back on finger by finger, taking <<his>> time about it.
      <br><br>
      "Gather-up soon." <<He>> checks that the gate is seated in its frame. "You'll want to be standing where I can see you."
      <br><br>
      <span class='purple'>Behind <<him>>, further down the barn, a farmhand is still moving between the stalls. Nobody comes over.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      雷米就这么停了，一根一根把手指套回手套里，动作很慢。
      <br><br>
      “快到收拢时间了。”<<He>>确认栏门还嵌在框里。“你最好站在我看得见的地方。”
      <br><br>
      <span class='purple'><<He>>身后，谷仓深处还有工人在栏位之间走动。没有人过来。</span>
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<clotheson>><<endcombat>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Next', '继续'] 'Livestock Cell'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>>
